# Converter OUTPUTS, produced by running sdf2spec*.js in this directory.
# The .sdf files here are inputs and are committed; these are not — a committed
# output is a second copy of molecules.js that drifts. tools/check-docs.js
# asserts both of these ABSENT via its KNOWN_ABSENT map, so committing one
# fails the doc check.
generated-specs.json
generated-specs-generic.json
